# RetroEng

A C# engine for retro 3D games on SDL3 and SDL_GPU (.NET 10): rendering
in an original palette look and an enhanced lit look, platform and input,
audio, collision, networking and an editor core.

| Package | Contents |
|---|---|
| RetroEng.Core | jobs, content, diagnostics, images, models, fixed loop |
| RetroEng.Platform | window, input, gamepads, dialogs, downloads (SDL3) |
| RetroEng.Render | SDL_GPU renderer: frame packets, materials, lights, shaders |
| RetroEng.Audio | SDL3 device, mixer, spatial sound |
| RetroEng.Physics | triangle grids, heightfields, sphere sweeps and rays |
| RetroEng.Net | client-server sessions over LiteNetLib |
| RetroEng.Editor | Dear ImGui host, picking, gizmos, undo |
| RetroEng.Native | SDL3 for win-x64 with a Direct3D 12 descriptor-heap fix |

